  "title": "Turn documentation into a context layer for production AI",
  "description": "This session examines a paradigm shift in AI transformation readiness: documentation as infrastructure. It reimagines an organization’s operating system, where processes, architecture standards, and workflows move from static archives to version‑controlled, computable logic. Learn how teams build a context layer that feeds AI systems with intent, standards, and constraints to improve reliability, scale, and real‑world outcomes.\n\nSeating for this session is first-come, first-served. Add it to your schedule to plan your day and arrive early to secure a spot.",
